{
  "borough": "Hounslow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed erection of a third floor roof extension would by reason of its position size, design and appearance, would be intrusive development, out of scale and character with the existing building and have a serious and adverse effect on the visual amenity of the locality and the wider conservation area, contrary to Local Plan policies SC7, CC1, CC2 and CC4 and London Plan Policy D4 and HC1 and the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 2 - The proposed new residential units provide inadequate quality of accommodation; due to poor outlook and light levels and so would be detrimental to the amenities enjoyed by prospective occupants of this development. The proposed development is therefore contrary to Local Plan policies SC5, CC2, and London Plan Policies D6 and the intent of the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 3 - The proposed roof terraces and doors would by reason of its position size, design and appearance, would be intrusive development, out of scale and character with the existing building and have a serious and adverse effect on the visual amenity of the locality and the wider conservation area, contrary to Local Plan policies SC7, CC1, CC2 and CC4 and London Plan Policy D4 and HC1 and the National Planning Policy Framework.",
    "Reason : 4 - The proposal does not provide a transport statement to justify the proposal and provides insufficient details on the parking. In addition, no cycle parking has been proposed for new flats, which would lead to an unsatisfactory development of the site and would fail to promote sustainable forms of transport. Thus, it would not comply with London Plan Policies T5, T6 and Local Plan Policies CC2, EC2.  ",
    "Reason : 5 - The details submitted with this application are insufficient because they fail to show waste and recycling storage and collection without which this Council is unable to fully assess the application and without which the proposals cannot be considered to satisfy the requirements of Policies CC2, EQ7 of the Local Plan and Policies SI7, T7 of London Plan. "
  ],
